          value="Selected APIM catalog/records and scoped hosted reads have their own audit/gateway evidence. Selected preview traces still have AppRequests/AppDependencies without joined backend audit: incomplete end-to-end proof. Neither is a live S2 user OBO audit pass."
          style="shape=label;rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF8E6;strokeColor=#986F0B;strokeWidth=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=4 3;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#323130;fontFamily=Segoe UI;spacing=8;"
