        <mxCell id="obo_proof" value="&lt;b&gt;Read this identity call's audit:&lt;/b&gt; query 01 filtered by the S2 probe's trace ID. Inspect identity_type, human_oid, optional human_name / human_username, delegated_scopes and calling app.&lt;br/&gt;Legacy agent_appid / agent_oid describe a generic caller: console OBO uses B/the human token subject, NOT an independent hosted agent. oid is authoritative; optional display claims are actual token claims only.&lt;br/&gt;Human sign-in + matching audit proof remains pending. Token metadata / row count is not proof. No model cost, business writes or user/record authorization; redact real operator PII." style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#F4F0F9;strokeColor=#5C2D91;fontColor=#201F1E;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;spacing=10;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
